{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_clt_70_1","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_70","textTraditional":"一、七年，春，齊人伐鄭。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_clt_70_2","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_70","textTraditional":"二、夏，小邾子來朝。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_clt_70_3","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_70","textTraditional":"三、鄭殺其大夫申侯。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_clt_70_4","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_70","textTraditional":"稱國以殺大夫，殺無罪也。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_clt_70_5","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_70","textTraditional":"四、秋，七月，公會齊侯、宋公、陳世子款、鄭世子華，盟於寧母。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_clt_70_6","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_70","textTraditional":"衣裳之會也。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_clt_70_7","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_70","textTraditional":"五、曹伯班卒。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_clt_70_8","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_70","textTraditional":"六、公子友如齊。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_clt_70_9","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_70","textTraditional":"七、冬，葬曹昭公。","sentenceOrder":9}],"overrides":{}}